<title>USA: PSA has new name -- PSA The Bond Market Trade Assn.</title>
<headline>PSA has new name -- PSA The Bond Market Trade Assn.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Public Securities Association (PSA) has a new name.</p>
<p>The trade association that represents banks and securities forms in all U.S. bond markets, including government, corporate, federal agency, municipal, mortgages and asset backed, funding and money market securities, said it is now known as &quot;PSA The Bond market Trade Association.&quot;</p>
<p>Given that the organization's work is no longer limited to &quot;public securities,&quot; the name was changed, PSA said.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
